#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&knotes; is a program that lets you write the computer equivalent of sticky "
"notes. The notes are saved automatically when you exit the program, and they "
"display when you open the program."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may print and mail your notes if you configure &knotes; to use helper "
"applications."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Display features of notes such as color and font may be customized for each "
"note. You may also customize the defaults."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &knotes;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a new note:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new note &RMB; click on the &knotes; panel icon and select "
"<guimenuitem>New Note</guimenuitem> or using the shortcut <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Alt;&Shift;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can create a new note containing the contents of the clipboard by "
"selecting <guimenuitem>New Note From Clipboard</guimenuitem> or using the "
"shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;&Shift;<keycap>C</keycap></"
"keycombo>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Writing your note:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To write your note, simply type the note in the space provided. Normal "
"keyboard and mouse editing functions are supported. <mousebutton>Right</"
"mousebutton> clicking in the editing space provides the following menu "
"options:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Anullar"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "Redo"
msgstr "Tornar far"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Cut</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copiar"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paste"
msgstr "Pegar"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Netejar"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select All"
msgstr "Tot seleccionar"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Text may be selected by holding down the &LMB; and moving the mouse, or by "
"holding down the &Shift; key and using the <keycap>arrow</keycap> keys."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inserting the date:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To insert the current date in the Note &RMB; click on the title bar of the "
"note and select <guimenuitem>Insert Date</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The current date and time will be inserted at the cursor position in the "
"text of the note."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renaming a note:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To rename a note &RMB; click on the note titlebar and select "
"<guimenuitem>Rename...</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type the new name of the note in the dialog that appears. To accept the new "
"name, press the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button. To exit the dialog without "
"renaming the note, press the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button. To clear "
"what you have typed and start over, click the <guibutton>Clear</guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mailing a note:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To mail a note &RMB; click on the note titlebar and select "
"<guimenuitem>Mail...</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"What happens next depends on how you configured the Mail action in the "
"<guilabel>Preferences...</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "Printing a note:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To print a note &RMB; click on the note titlebar and select "
"<guimenuitem>Print</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "A standard &kde; print dialog will open."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting a note:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete a note &RMB; click on the note titlebar and select "
"<guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hiding a note:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To hide a note, click the <guiicon>X</guiicon> in the upper right corner of "
"the titlebar of the note. The note will no longer be displayed on the "
"screen. The note itself will not be deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid "Displaying notes:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start &knotes;, all notes will display on the screen. If you hide a "
"note and later want to display it, &LMB; on the &knotes; panel icon and "
"select the note you wish to display."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "Desktop functions:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To send a note to a specific desktop, &RMB; click on the title bar of the "
"note and select <guisubmenu>To Desktop</guisubmenu>. Choose the desktop "
"desired, or alternatively, <guimenuitem>All desktops</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To make the note remain on top of other windows &RMB; click on the titlebar "
"of the note and select <guimenuitem>Always On Top</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To return the note to more normal window behavior, simply repeat this "
"process."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quitting &knotes;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To quit &knotes; &RMB; click on the panel icon and select <guimenuitem>Quit</"
"guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuracion"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &knotes; Default Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To configure &knotes; &RMB; click on the panel icon. Select "
"<guimenuitem>Configure KNotes...</guimenuitem> The &knotes; <guilabel>KNotes "
"Defaults</guilabel> dialog will open."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Display</guilabel> Section"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text color:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The color square shows the current text color. By clicking this color square "
"you open the standard &kde; color selection dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background color:"
msgstr "Color de fons :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The color square shows the current background color. By clicking this color "
"square you open the standard &kde; color selection dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "Default width:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "The width of the note in pixels. Edit this number as desired."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "Default height:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "The height of the note in pixels. Edit this number as desired."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show note in taskbar"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, &knotes; notes do not show an entry in the taskbar for each "
"note. If you prefer they do so, enable this option."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Editor</guilabel> Section"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tab Size"
msgstr "Talha de la tabulacion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the size of the indent produced by the &Tab; key in spaces. Edit "
"this number as desired."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto Indent"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "This is a check box. If selected, auto-indenting is on."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rich Text"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Not yet implemented"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Title Font: Click to Change"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can change the font used for the title of your notes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293 index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click this button to open the standard &kde; font selection dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text Font: Click to Change"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can change the font used for the text of your notes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Actions</guilabel> Section"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mail Action"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Type a mail command and any required command line switches in this box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By using <token>%f</token> in the command line you can pass the filename of "
"the note body to the mail command."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing a Single Note Display"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can customize each note independently of the global settings. The "
"settings you can customize are identical to those described in the <link "
"linkend=\"configuration\">Configuration</link> section, but they will apply "
"only to the note you are changing. Any other open notes, and any new notes "
"you create, will use the default settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To customize a single note display &RMB; click on the note title bar and "
"select <guimenuitem>Preferences...</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Local Settings</guilabel> dialog will open, allowing you to "
"configure the note."
msgstr ""

